[SPEAKER_01]: Literally, the Buddha told him, in scene, let there just be the scene, in heard, smell, taste, touch.

309
00:21:47,009 --> 00:21:49,191
[SPEAKER_01]: And he became fully enlightened, arahant, right there and then.

310
00:21:49,291 --> 00:21:50,832
[SPEAKER_01]: You think like, wow, this is so miraculous.

311
00:21:51,572 --> 00:21:55,795
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, because he was living as this bhāg aesthetic, for who knows how long.

312
00:21:56,375 --> 00:21:57,436
[SPEAKER_01]: I mean, that's an austere life.

313
00:21:58,876 --> 00:22:01,558
[SPEAKER_01]: Cover yourself with bhāg and probably eat every few days.

314
00:22:02,398 --> 00:22:05,440
[SPEAKER_01]: And he fully developed his mind on account of it, to the point that he genuinely thought

