316
00:22:12,549 --> 00:22:14,270
[SPEAKER_01]: He had genuinely done all the work.

317
00:22:14,690 --> 00:22:21,692
[SPEAKER_01]: And then, the deva, out of compassion, because he was so close already, said, actually, no, you're not, but go and visit the blessed one, and he'll tell you.

