00:22:22,493 --> 00:22:28,235
[SPEAKER_01]: And yeah, he just needed one line, one sentence, and he became fully enlightened, because everything was already there.

319
00:22:28,855 --> 00:22:30,975
[SPEAKER_01]: There's complete withdrawal, understanding, non-ownership.

320
00:22:31,035 --> 00:22:33,356
[SPEAKER_01]: Now, just he recognized it, because it was there.

321
00:22:33,916 --> 00:22:37,918
[SPEAKER_01]: If he didn't have it there, the instruction would not have made him an arhant, would not have made him even a s

322
00:22:39,687 --> 00:22:43,649
[SPEAKER_01]: So, instruction makes you discern things if those things are there.

323
00:22:44,390 --> 00:22:47,812
[SPEAKER_01]: Which means that's where the mind development and sense restraint needs to be done beforehand.

324
00:22:47,892 --> 00:22:50,694
