[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, no doubt, no doubt.

327
00:22:56,037 --> 00:22:57,818
[SPEAKER_01]: He was probably quite, quite established.

328
00:22:58,475 --> 00:22:59,856
[SPEAKER_02]: Whereas today, it seems...

329
00:22:59,976 --> 00:23:03,418
